%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
% Two-source HPGe gamma test.
% Source 1: natural-background gamma spectrum from x=-400 mm.
% Source 2: Co-60 gamma lines from x=-800 mm, collimated toward +X.
